WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:12.012
♪ This bitter earth ♪

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.103
♪ What fruit it bears ♪

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.439
[over broadcast]
My fellow citizens of the world

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:25.359
What I have to say to you
is not something I was

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:27.444
ever prepared to say.

00:00:27.444 --> 00:00:29.947
♪♪

00:00:29.947 --> 00:00:32.532
As many of you know
by now, we are suffering from

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.494
inexplicable and seemingly
unrelated incidents.

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:39.456
♪ That no one shares ♪

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:41.291
Ranging from power outages

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:44.836
to the destruction of
infrastructure and homes.

00:00:44.836 --> 00:00:48.048
♪ This bitter earth ♪

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:52.594
We now believe these incidents
are not unrelated,

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.222
but in fact connected.

00:00:55.222 --> 00:00:56.223
♪♪

00:00:58.016 --> 00:01:00.352
What is being visited
upon our Earth ---

00:01:00.352 --> 00:01:01.144
Contact front!

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:03.146
[gunfire]

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:06.525
--- is not of our Earth.

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:07.359
[static]

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:10.237
[siren]

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:11.113
Listen to me.

00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:12.739
We're leaving. Now!

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.616
That's my car! Hey!

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:15.993
I'm keeping us safe.

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.411
Safe from what?

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:21.957
Your squad was lost 
in an encounter.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:23.834
Was that your only encounter?
-No.

00:01:25.294 --> 00:01:26.295
♪♪

00:01:37.306 --> 00:01:39.725
♪ And if my life ♪

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:43.687
♪ Is like the dust ♪

00:01:43.687 --> 00:01:47.983
♪ Ooh, that hides the glow ♪

00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:49.776
We might be all that stands

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:51.403
between life as we know it

00:01:51.403 --> 00:01:52.696
and the end of all existence.

00:01:57.159 --> 00:02:00.495
♪ Heaven only knows ♪

00:02:00.495 --> 00:02:02.497
The world wants to test us

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.625
to see if it can break us.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.669
Help me! Please!

00:02:12.591 --> 00:02:14.426
Not today.

00:02:14.426 --> 00:02:15.677
♪♪

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:19.306
♪ This bitter earth ♪

00:02:19.306 --> 00:02:22.517
♪ May not be so ♪

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:28.607
♪ bitter after all ♪

